OL,3,ADetective raped by colleague says Met
OL,4,Ahandling of case 'like being raped
OL,5,Aagain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Metropolitan Police detective, who
OL,8,Fwas raped by a fellow officer, has told
OL,9,Fthe BBC that Scotland Yard's handling
OL,10,Fof her case was "like being raped all
OL,11,Fover again".
OL,13,FDet Con Linda Williams was attacked in
OL,14,F2004 by PC David Carrick - a serial
OL,15,Fabuser jailed for life in 2023 for
OL,16,Fsexual offences against her and 11
OL,17,Fother women.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
