OL,3,AThousands without power as Storm Austen
OL,4,Alashes south-west England and the
OL,5,AChannel Islands
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 5,000 homes in Cornwall are
OL,8,Fcurrently experiencing power cuts,
OL,9,FNational Grid reports, as Storm Austen
OL,10,Fsweeps across parts of the UK
OL,12,FThe Met Office has issued an amber
OL,13,Fweather warning for strong winds for
OL,14,FCornwall and parts of Devon
OL,16,FMeanwhile, a red warning in place for
OL,17,FGuernsey and Jersey
OL,19,FGusts of up to 80mph are set to hit the
OL,20,FSouth West and the Channel Islands
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
