OL,3,AThousands without power as Storm Austen
OL,4,Alashes south-west England and the
OL,5,AChannel Islands
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll schools in Jersey have been told to
OL,8,Fclose on Friday. A number of schools
OL,9,Fare also closed or opening late in
OL,10,FCornwall
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
