OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APrepare for supply chain disruption
OL,4,Afrom cyber or climate emergencies,
OL,5,AStreeting warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe added that the government was
OL,8,Flaunching a "national resilience
OL,9,Fconversation" to raise awareness,
OL,10,Fincluding advice for households like
OL,11,Fstocking up on food, bottled water and
OL,12,Ffirst aid supplies.
OL,14,FStreeting also said that cyber
OL,15,Fincidents - like the recently
OL,16,Fdiscovered critical security flaw in
OL,17,Fthe programming language which powers
OL,18,Fmuch of the internet - will happen
OL,19,F"more and more".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
